Pol VPN for OpenWrt

This project adapts the configuration and Worker protocol of BPB-VPN:
https://github.com/bia-pain-bache/BPB-VPN
Source revision: 2b5dd87d7a000c2ef13307ee315fae14441b4f3a
BPB-VPN is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.
The bundled Worker, SSH proxy, scanner pause fix and domain-fronting template
include changes from BPB-VPN v1.3.0 (4ae76d3f9479541675a7ad5276208186599f2209).
The Go configuration builder
is an OpenWrt adaptation of its lib/services/xray_config.dart.

Xray-core is independently distributed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0:
https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core
Its license is included with the Pol package.

The dashboard stylesheet adapts Zirgozar theme.css by dreamboxone:
https://github.com/dreamboxone/zirgozar
This stylesheet is licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later; its copyright header and
license are included in dashboard.css and licenses/Zirgozar-AGPL-3.0.txt. Vazirmatn font files are distributed
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; the font's OFL.txt is included.

DNS Rebind exception ownership behavior and direct-routing controls follow
Zirgozar by dreamboxone (AGPL-3.0-or-later); see licenses/Zirgozar-AGPL-3.0.txt.

Portable scanner, Psiphon exit and networking modules in third_party/bpb are
from BPB-VPN revision 2b5dd87d7a000c2ef13307ee315fae14441b4f3a, GPL-3.0.
Their original comments and module dependency attributions are retained.

Tor bridge transports in third_party/lyrebird are from The Tor Project,
Lyrebird 0.10.0, revision 59ac7e400c384773f5584dbe366516ad04a33d9f.
Original copyright and BSD/GPL license files are retained in that directory.

The domain-fronting template is patterniha MITM-DomainFronting v23 (GPL-3.0),
as adapted by BPB-VPN. Its original __Credits__ metadata is retained in
/usr/share/pol/domain-fronting.json and the source template.
